        "created_at": "2015-10-23T23:27:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello everybody. Im looking for help in finishing off my kick starter campaign. It didnt start off that great, but has recently picked up. I was hoping the fans of Sentinels of the Multiverse could help! The campaign has less then 2 days left and trying to make a comeback. You guys can check it out here https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/1695965173/the-dauntless/posts/1392311 and thanks for looking. Feel free to message me on here on a PM or on my email.&nbsp;</p>",
