        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-23T23:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I guess it's a comic book? It doesn't really say that anywhere on the top of the campaign page or even here in your message to us. Maybe the KS video says it, but I wasn't hooked quickly enough to want to click \"play\". Waaaay at the bottom of the campaign page it mentions books. You may be able to improve the response you're getting by focusing the info you're sharing on Kickstarter. Might need to \"sell\" it better.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:28:25.436Z",
