        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I guess it&#39;s a comic book? It doesn&#39;t really say that anywhere on the top of the campaign page or even here in your message to us. Maybe the KS video says it, but I wasn&#39;t hooked quickly enough to want to click &quot;play&quot;. Waaaay at the bottom of the campaign page it mentions books. You may be able to improve the response you&#39;re getting by focusing the info you&#39;re sharing on Kickstarter. Might need to &quot;sell&quot; it better.&nbsp;</p>",
